    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University (AKU) and Rahat Kada Hospice, Karachi, have signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) to strengthen palliative and end-of-life care services in Pakistan. The agreement formalizes collaboration in training, capacity-building and patient support, with a focus on improving access to compassionate care for those with life-limiting illnesses.",
